As at 6-9-2026:

JavaScript Directory (/js/)
ai.js: AI decision runner and history manager; wraps ForeseeEngine with difficulty-based probabilistic softmax action selection and maintains a rolling 24-turn match history buffer (remember).

combat_core.js: Pure deterministic combat rules and state resolution engine (CombatCore); handles move compilation, stance/Chi costs, 3-tier range priority (Projectile 3 > Reach/Rope 2 > Melee 1), damage formulas, guard matching, status buffs/debuffs, faint stun thresholds, and outcome probability distributions (distribution).

combat_engine.js: Live combat playback adapter (CombatPlayback); processes resolution trace events from CombatCore to orchestrate UI animations, side media reactions, floating popups, center action video cutscenes, and HUD state updates.

combat_tests.js: Automated combat rule unit test suite (runCombatTests) and AI difficulty benchmark harness (benchmarkDifficulties); verifies state immutability, PRNG determinism, interrupt logic, status effects, and spatial symmetry.

common.js: Shared utility library (KF); provides math helpers (clamp), async timers (wait), FNV-1a hashing (hash), Mulberry32 deterministic PRNG (rng), difficulty parameter levels (levels), global combat rules, charge calculators, and singleton JSON data preloader (loadData).

cpu_controller.js: Asynchronous CPU planning dispatcher (AIService); manages a dual Web Worker pool running ai_worker.js off the main UI thread with synchronous fallback.

foresee_engine.js: Multi-turn predictive decision engine (ForeseeEngine); combines Depth-1 Expectimax evaluation matrix with RiderBrains tactical prior heuristics and Monte Carlo horizon rollouts for top finalist moves.

game.js: Game lifecycle controller and screen navigation engine (GameView); manages application startup, session transition race-condition guards, HUD painting, finish states, and returning to character selection.

match_manager.js: Live turn input controller; binds keyboard/touch controls (WASD/Arrows + Action buttons), updates real-time charge progress bars, enforces time limits, and triggers playback resolution.

media.js: Media asset controller; manages video element preloading, mobile audio/video unlocking, center cutscene playback, and dynamic side sprite/video state changes.

rider_brains.js: Character-specific tactical intelligence profiles (RiderBrains); provides static prior move weights, tactical intent classifiers, state evaluation heuristics, and situational bonuses.

simulator.js: Headless batch simulation engine and replay verifier (Simulator); executes background CPU vs. CPU matches (10 to 50+ runs) to collect statistical win-rate/LP/Chi analytics and verifies deterministic match replays (verifyReplay).

storage.js: Persistence manager; handles localStorage operations for saved AI learning history, user preferences, and match statistics.

ui.js: Battle HUD renderer (UI); updates LP/Chi progress bars, faint meters, dynamic status tags for Low Power (<5 Chi) / Full Power (>14 Chi) thresholds, and floating damage text popups.

vs_select.js: 3-step character selection screen controller; manages Rider cycling, control mode toggles (Human/CPU), mirror match palette swaps, background music (BGM), and triggers the batch simulation modal.

CSS Directory (/css/)
style.css: Master stylesheet defining layouts, battle screen HUDs, dynamic Chi/Faint bar fill tracks, center video viewport containers, damage popups, virtual controller D-pad grids, and responsive theme overrides.

Data Directory (/data/)
moves.json: Master move set database defining direction inputs, action buttons, classification types, Chi costs, base damage, hit probabilities, buff/debuff definitions, and associated video clip files per Rider.

riders.json: Character roster database storing base stats (LP, orientation, facing directions), video folder paths, tactical archetypes, active availability flags, and signature move attributes.

Root Directory (HTML / Views)
index.html: Playable game application entry point featuring orientation overlay, loading screen, character selection wizard, live battle viewport, dynamic DOM template builders, and script dependency cascade.

index_test.html: Automated browser testing dashboard for running regression test suites (runCombatTests) and optional 4-match AI mirror benchmarks on-screen.
